---
// BeP09 figure: BeP09Orbiter
---
<figure class="bep9n1">
  <div class="bep9n1-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 315" role="img" aria-label="Two correct halves of the Mars Climate Orbiter. Ground software writes thruster data in pound-force seconds, navigation software reads the same file as newton-seconds, and the join between them was never tested end to end, so the spacecraft ended about 170 kilometers lower than planned at Mars insertion. The spacecraft software itself used metric units and was correct.">
    <rect x="40" y="40" width="270" height="92" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="175" y="68" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>ground software</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ground software</tspan></text>
    <text x="175" y="92" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>writes thruster data in</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ghi dữ liệu lực đẩy theo</tspan></text>
    <text x="175" y="110" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>pound-force seconds</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>pound-force giây</tspan></text>
    <rect x="560" y="40" width="300" height="92" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="710" y="68" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>navigation software</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>navigation software</tspan></text>
    <text x="710" y="92" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>reads the same file as</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đọc cùng file đó như là</tspan></text>
    <text x="710" y="110" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>newton-seconds</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>newton-giây</tspan></text>
    <line x1="310" y1="86" x2="540" y2="86" class="redln" />
    <polygon points="550,86 540,81 540,91" class="redhd" />
    <text x="430" y="72" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>one file</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một file</tspan></text>
    <text x="430" y="114" text-anchor="middle" class="redt"><tspan data-lang-en>the join: no end-to-end test</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chỗ nối: không có test end-to-end</tspan></text>
    <rect x="40" y="190" width="270" height="80" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="175" y="218" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>spacecraft software</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>spacecraft software</tspan></text>
    <text x="175" y="244" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>metric, and correct</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dùng hệ mét, và đúng</tspan></text>
    <line x1="710" y1="132" x2="710" y2="174" class="redln" />
    <polygon points="710,184 705,174 715,174" class="redhd" />
    <text x="710" y="208" text-anchor="middle" class="redt"><tspan data-lang-en>about 170 km lower than planned</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>thấp hơn kế hoạch khoảng 170 km</tspan></text>
    <text x="710" y="228" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>at Mars insertion</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lúc vào quỹ đạo sao Hỏa</tspan></text>
    <text x="430" y="296" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>each half is consistent with its own assumption</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mỗi nửa đều nhất quán với giả định của riêng nó</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Three parts, each right by its own assumption. The error exists only on the arrow between two of them, and that is the part no test looked at.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Ba phần, phần nào cũng đúng theo giả định của riêng nó. Lỗi chỉ tồn tại trên mũi tên giữa hai phần, và đó là chỗ không test nào nhìn tới.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep9n1 { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep9n1-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep9n1 svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .bep9n1 text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep9n1 .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep9n1 .nm { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep9n1 .bs { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep9n1 .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep9n1 .code { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep9n1 .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep9n1 .redbox { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.2; }
  .bep9n1 .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep9n1 .redln { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.2; }
  .bep9n1 .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep9n1 .redhd { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep9n1 .bar { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .bep9n1 .redbar { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep9n1 figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
